{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","共形映射"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","将自己和一名敌人转移到其他空间。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","选择一名敌人，对其造成230% + 20% ATK伤害，并使自身和该敌人转移至另一维度的空间中，持续10秒。除召唤物外，若敌方存活人数多于己方，则自身会留在场上。当该目标处于稳定、霸体或敌方存活的非召唤物角色仅剩该目标时，则不会将其转移，而是造成450% ATK伤害。本技能优先选择最健康的非召唤物敌人作为目标。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":87,"end":89,"tooltip_key":"keyword:stable"},{"start":90,"end":92,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":123,"end":131,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":141,"end":145,"tooltip_key":"keyword:strongest"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","释放“共形映射”时，若敌方除召唤物外存活的人数比我方多至少2名，则“共形映射”会额外对一名敌人生效，该敌人转移至另一维度的空间的持续时间降低至7秒。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至250% + 20% ATK，当该目标处于稳定、霸体或敌方存活的非召唤物角色仅剩该目标时，伤害提升至460% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":26,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"keyword:stable"},{"start":29,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":55,"end":63,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至260% + 20% ATK，当该目标处于稳定、霸体或敌方存活的非召唤物角色仅剩该目标时，伤害提升至480% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":26,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"keyword:stable"},{"start":29,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":55,"end":63,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至270% + 20% ATK，当该目标处于稳定、霸体或敌方存活的非召唤物角色仅剩该目标时，伤害提升至500% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":26,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"keyword:stable"},{"start":29,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":55,"end":63,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","动态平衡"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，雷内亚使一名友方英雄和与之处于对称位置的敌方英雄交换位置。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，若自身1格范围内存在一名友军与敌军的位置处于对称关系，雷内亚将会释放本技能使双方互换位置，优先以自身身后的友军作为目标。该敌军每次受到伤害时，该友军恢复等同于伤害量45%的生命值，持续到战斗结束，通过这个方式每连续8秒内恢复生命值的总量不超过1000% + 100% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":132,"end":139,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":28,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"keyword:symmetric"},{"start":127,"end":143,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","友方英雄恢复等同于伤害量46%的生命值。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","友方英雄恢复等同于伤害量48%的生命值。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","友方英雄恢复等同于伤害量50%的生命值。"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","黄金比例"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","对敌人造成多段伤害并击飞。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","透过传送门对最健康的敌人进行猛烈的击打，造成打断效果并对其造成8次45% + 3% ATK伤害，随后施展最后一拳造成120% ATK伤害并将其击飞。若敌人生命值比例高于61.8%，每次攻击附带敌人当前生命值1%伤害，最多不超过自身攻击力的20%。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":36,"end":41,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":10,"tooltip_key":"keyword:strongest"},{"start":22,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"keyword:interrupteff"},{"start":33,"end":45,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":58,"end":66,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每个敌人生命值比例首次低于61.8%时，雷内亚感受到一阵满足，使自身恢复200% ATK生命值和80点能量。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":36,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每次攻击附带伤害提升至敌人当前生命值的1.2%。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","每个敌人生命值比例首次低于61.8%时，雷内亚还会与友军分享满足感，使所有友军恢复120% ATK生命值和50点能量。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":41,"end":49,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","使“动态平衡”交换位置的友军攻击力提升，交换位置的敌军攻击力降低。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","“动态平衡”互换的友军攻击力提升7%，互换的敌军攻击力降低7%。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“动态平衡”互换的友军攻击力提升10%，互换的敌军攻击力降低10%。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“动态平衡”互换的友军攻击力提升12%，互换的敌军攻击力降低12%。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","调和美学"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","雷内亚重创“动态平衡”交换位置的敌军，使其受到伤害提升，并降低交换位置的友军受到的伤害。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","释放“动态平衡”时，还会对该敌人造成200% ATK伤害并击倒，使其受到伤害提高25%，持续到战斗结束。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","对该敌人造成伤害提升至250% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","释放“动态平衡”还会使该友军受到伤害降低25%，持续到战斗结束。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","对该敌人造成伤害提升至300% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，与敌方英雄处于对称关系的我方英雄攻击力提升。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，我方英雄的位置若与敌方英雄处于对称关系，则攻击力提升4%，持续到战斗结束。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"keyword:symmetric"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","镜像魔环"]]}